{"version":1,"content":"<p>楊明和冼靖峰在《超時空男臣II》演出㿭加入色。</p><p>他們今日（4日）在電視城舉行開鏡拜神儀式。</p><p>楊明表示拍攝前有重溫第一季的經典「食雪糕」場口，與蕭正楠、曹永廉和何廣沛相識多年，所以能夠參演感到好開心，今次因為演奸角，無緣搞笑戲份。</p><p>冼靖峰表示10年</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T10:42:22.958311+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T10:22:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T10:35:14.601699+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T10:35:14.601699+00:00","content_hash":"278cacead44eb1265a19eb43eee927119ade8029998b9062a767cc95edd99ca0","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}